# Class Reunion (battlefield.class_reunion, CloisterOfFrost): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Ice_Protocrystal
# (arena 1's), in the battlefield: 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4:
# still inside. Again, finished with 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). Then IP_Entrance, no trade: the
# clearance is kept (effect 254, power 481), so the override's non-registrant arm (isValidEntry) passes: the menu 32000
# again.
lists CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFrost/Ice_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfFrost/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfFrost/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=561.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
charvar ClassReunionProgress 5
item IcePendulum
login
trade IP_Entrance IcePendulum x1      # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Ice_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Ice_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp 561.5,-0.8,600.0 CloisterOfFrost
trigger IP_Entrance                     # the clearance kept: the helper arm: the menu 32000 again
